Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.35,0:00:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你進來之後有把門鎖上嗎?\N{\fs28\i1}Did you lock the door behind you?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.84,0:00:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我以為是你鎖的。\N{\fs28\i1}I thought you did.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.17,0:00:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,算了,我們只有十分鐘。\N{\fs28\i1}Never mind. We have ten minutes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.21,0:00:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,十分鐘要做什麼?\N{\fs28\i1}Ten minutes for what, exactly?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.25,0:00:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,在他們回來之前找到那捲帶子。\N{\fs28\i1}To find the tape before they come back.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.25,0:00:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你說過它在辦公室裡。\N{\fs28\i1}You said it was in the office.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.31,0:00:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,本來在,有人把它移走了。\N{\fs28\i1}It was. Someone moved it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那你怎麼知道它還在這裡?\N{\fs28\i1}Then how do you know it is still here?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.64,0:00:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,因為還沒有人離開這棟樓。\N{\fs28\i1}Because nobody has left the building.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.58,0:00:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,這聽起來一點也不讓人放心。\N{\fs28\i1}That is not very comforting.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.49,0:00:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你去查櫃子,我來找書桌。\N{\fs28\i1}Check the cabinet. I will take the desk.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,鎖住了。\N{\fs28\i1}It is locked.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,想也知道。\N{\fs28\i1}Of course it is.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.08,0:00:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,等等,我找到東西了。\N{\fs28\i1}Wait. I found something.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.67,0:01:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是那捲帶子嗎?\N{\fs28\i1}Is it the tape?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.15,0:01:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不是,是一張我們的合照。\N{\fs28\i1}No. It is a photograph of us.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.10,0:01:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能。\N{\fs28\i1}That is impossible.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你看背面的日期。\N{\fs28\i1}Look at the date on the back.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.89,0:01:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,明天。\N{\fs28\i1}Tomorrow.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.31,0:01:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在耍我們。\N{\fs28\i1}Somebody is playing a game with us.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.03,0:01:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,或者是在警告我們。\N{\fs28\i1}Or warning us.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.40,0:01:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你有聽到嗎?\N{\fs28\i1}Did you hear that?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.02,0:01:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是電梯,他們提早回來了。\N{\fs28\i1}The elevator. They are early.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.81,0:01:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,現在怎麼辦?\N{\fs28\i1}What do we do now?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.91,0:01:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,帶上照片,快跑。\N{\fs28\i1}We take the photograph and we run.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.40,0:01:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你會這麼說。\N{\fs28\i1}I knew you would say that.{\i0}
